# THE CLIMB UP THE HALF-BROKEN WALKER (ROADMAP slice 3 step 7, 43_climb), by
# real keys, from the tread to the enclave. The straddling walker is staged five
# world minutes after its foot came down in this world's first tread; on a
# crater's lip `use` puts him on the ankle's drum, and the move up key takes him
# up, ledge to ledge, five pitches: the drum, below the knee, the thigh, near the
# hip, and the hub's rim. He climbs as a climber reads the gait: on each ledge he
# rests to a full breath and sets off only when his leg will stand for the next
# section (`climb_ready`), and between pitches he rides up inside the bone while
# the eye goes up the outside of the leg. At the rim the panel in the crown is
# read, and listening to it he meets the enclave. The whole of it is about a
# world day, some fifteen real minutes, dawn to the next night.
#   TOUR_TIMEOUT=2400 tools/tour.sh tours/colossi_climb.tour --seed=1 --place=tread0 --colossus=2@tread0+5 --hour=6 --weather=clear:0 --stats
coast calm
await colossus_tread 30
near colossus_rim
await climb_rim 5
wait 2
shot 00-at-the-rim with colossus_tread,climb_rim
tap use
await climbing 3
await climb_patch 10
wait 1
shot 01-on-the-drum with climbing,climb_patch
perf stats begin drum
wait 2
perf stats end drum
# The drum, ledge to ledge, until its top takes him into the bone.
try 12
release move_up
until climb_ready 240
hold move_up
await climb:ledge 60
release move_up
await climb:rode 0.1
end
wait 8
shot 02-riding-up-the-shin with climb_riding
until climb_ready 240
shot 03-below-the-knee with climbing,climb_patch
try 12
release move_up
until climb_ready 240
hold move_up
await climb:ledge 60
release move_up
await climb:rode 0.1
end
wait 8
shot 04-riding-up-the-thigh with climb_riding
until climb_ready 240
shot 05-on-the-thigh with climbing,climb_patch
perf stats begin thigh
wait 2
perf stats end thigh
try 16
release move_up
until climb_ready 240
hold move_up
await climb:ledge 60
release move_up
await climb:rode 0.1
end
until climb_ready 240
shot 06-near-the-hip with climbing,climb_patch
try 12
release move_up
until climb_ready 240
hold move_up
await climb:ledge 60
release move_up
await climb:rode 0.1
end
until climb_ready 240
shot 07-under-the-hubs-rim with climbing,climb_patch
perf stats begin hatch
wait 2
perf stats end hatch
try 12
release move_up
until climb_ready 240
hold move_up
await climb:ledge 60
release move_up
await climb:at_hub 0.1
end
await talking 5
wait 1
shot 08-the-panel-in-the-crown with talking
tap use
await beat:enclave_met 5
wait 1
shot 09-it-counts-him with talking
tap use
await climb:down 10
wait 2
shot 10-back-at-the-rim with climbed
